{"operations":[{"content":"The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of the statute[[cite:obs-dc5c8852cd2ced9d2a94844c352b73a08d32abd7 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and are shredded afterwards[[cite:obs-75ad4d661f69b0f44258052fff2f58bad856c204 \"Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the statute's retention rule and the duration for which records are kept, each supported by exact source citations as required."}